  "additionalProperties": false,
  "description": "Credential-free direct grants, granted roles, default roles and non-secret attributes by exact user and host. Inherited grants are represented by their own role rows, never conflated with the direct account. Grant text normalizes privilege/column order, spacing and quoting; identifier case is significant. Unreadable attributes, account details or sides produce not_compared with a reason. Authentication hashes and internal parsed privilege models are never emitted. Rows and their side accounts expose system as a boolean for built-in system accounts. Protected ordinary users remain ordinary accounts."
